# MEML 当前产品能力的可执行自记忆记录。
# 记录 Agent 如何基于上下文检索策略、执行操作、回写结果并形成可追溯经验。

observe meml provides contextual-agent-memory product success at 20260824 as product
observe meml routes candidates token-normalized-retrieval success at 20260824 as routing
observe meml persists semantic-state-with-revision product success at 20260824 as persistence
observe meml validates strict-source-and-state-boundaries product success at 20260824 as safety

assert meml kernel owns-identity-ranking-conflicts-and-explanations architecture confidence 0.98 as kernel
assert meml providers generate-candidates-only architecture confidence 0.98 as providers
assert meml source supports-line-diagnostics-links-unlinks-and-verified-feedback language confidence 0.99 as source_feedback
assert meml persistence provides-semantic-and-index-journals durability confidence 0.99 as durable_state
assert meml feedback-verifier rejects-untrusted-results safety confidence 0.99 as trusted_feedback
assert meml feedback-policy configures-domain-reinforcement-and-penalties safety confidence 0.99 as feedback_policy
