# Agent 应用闭环：策略被检索后，真实执行结果以 evidence 写回目标，
# 形成 supports 或 contradicts 关系，并调整下次上下文检索的置信度与强度。
assert meml strategy-feedback improves-future-contextual-selection agent confidence 0.8 as feedback_loop
feedback feedback_loop success none actor trusted-agent receipt receipt-self-memory at 20260824
link feedback_loop supports kernel weight 1
link durable_state supports safety weight 1

